      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "\"sometimes we just want to be able to invite certain people without others getting curious and being able to join anyway.\"\n-> Do invite+ then, it is there for that exact purpose that you exactly know who is getting in and who not.\nBut back to topic:\nA couple of friends and I did try it out a couple of weeks ago as well, with one person on orange creating a new friends+ world, we were able to join him via world listing, despite we should technically not have been able to.\nYes, it would be nice if the api would not show friends+ lobbies if the people which would allow you to join are on orange. But getting rid of friends+ listings in general - clear no to that.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
