      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't see why the proposed solution to this is to make Friends+ more limited when you can just make an Invite+ instance. Friends+ is inherently open to your friends and anyone else's friends. If you want to limit the scope of who can enter an instance, then create an Invite+ instance. I make Friends+ instances because I *want* people to be able to join on me.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
