      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d21c1a8154b187933d51a3e|full_name}: If you want people to join on you then why are you on Orange?\nIf I want my friends to join I will be om green. If I don't want them joining I will be on orange. I don't want to force everyone in the instance to move somewhere else.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
