  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-18T04:43:29.751Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So I found out that if a friend creates a friends+ instance of a world, even while they are all on orange, if I know which world they are in, I can click on that world in the world search and that friends+ instance will be listed with all the public instances, and that means I can join them without asking. This should not be a thing. Please get rid of listing friends+ instances under worlds, sometimes we just want to be able to invite certain people without others getting curious and being able to join anyway.",
